sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Code
    participant API as Training Hub API<br/>sft() / lora_grpo() / gepa()
    participant Registry as AlgorithmRegistry
    participant Algo as Algorithm Instance<br/>(SFT/OSFT/LoRA/GRPO/GEPA)
    participant Backend as Backend Implementation
    participant Framework as External Framework<br/>(instructlab/unsloth/ART/verl/gepa)
    participant LLM as LLM API<br/>(via litellm)
    participant MLflow as MLflow Tracking<br/>Server
    participant WandB as Weights & Biases<br/>API

    Note over User,WandB: Library Invocation Flow

    User->>API: import training_hub<br/>training_hub.lora_grpo(model, data, ...)
    API->>Registry: Look up algorithm + backend<br/>for requested training type
    Registry-->>API: Algorithm-Backend pair

    API->>Algo: Initialize with parameters<br/>(model, data, hyperparameters)
    Algo->>Algo: Validate required/optional params

    alt verl Backend (subprocess)
        Algo->>Backend: Dispatch training
        Backend->>Backend: Convert data to Parquet format<br/>(verl input schema)
        Backend->>Framework: subprocess.run()<br/>Launch Ray/torchrun workers
        Note over Framework: Multi-GPU/Multi-Node<br/>FSDP Sharding
        Framework->>LLM: GRPO reward scoring<br/>OPENAI_API_KEY / OPENAI_API_BASE
        LLM-->>Framework: Reward scores
        Framework-->>Backend: Training complete
    else ART Backend (co-located engine)
        Algo->>Backend: Dispatch training
        Backend->>Framework: Manage vLLM AsyncLLM engine
        Framework->>LLM: Reward scoring<br/>OPENAI_API_KEY
        LLM-->>Framework: Reward scores
        Framework-->>Backend: Training complete
    else In-Process Backend (instructlab/unsloth/gepa)
        Algo->>Backend: Dispatch training
        Backend->>Framework: Direct in-process call
        Note over Backend,Framework: GEPA backend manages<br/>env var lifecycle<br/>(save/restore semantics)
        Framework-->>Backend: Training complete
    end

    opt MLflow Tracking Enabled
        Backend->>MLflow: Log metrics, parameters<br/>MLFLOW_TRACKING_URI
        MLflow-->>Backend: Tracking confirmation
    end

    opt W&B Logging Enabled
        Backend->>WandB: Log training metrics<br/>WANDB_API_KEY / WANDB_ENTITY
        WandB-->>Backend: Logging confirmation
    end

    Backend-->>Algo: Training results
    Algo-->>API: Return results
    API-->>User: Training output
